
@loanId = LOAN_ID
@condominiumId = CONDOMINIUM_ID

### Login vecino1
POST localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "vecino1",
  "password": "Vecino123@"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("v1_token", response.body.token);
%}

### Login vecino2
POST localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "vecino2",
  "password": "Vecino123@"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("v2_token", response.body.token);
%}

### Login vecino3
POST localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "vecino3",
  "password": "Vecino123@"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("v3_token", response.body.token);
%}

### vecino1 califica a vecino2 -> 201
POST localhost:3000/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{v1_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "loanId": "{{loanId}}",
  "stars": 4,
  "comment": "Todo bien, lo devolvió a tiempo"
}

### vecino1 califica otra vez el mismo préstamo -> 409
POST localhost:3000/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{v1_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "loanId": "{{loanId}}",
  "stars": 5
}

### vecino2 califica a vecino1 sin comentario -> 201
POST localhost:3000/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{v2_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "loanId": "{{loanId}}",
  "stars": 5,
  "comment": ""
}

### Estrellas fuera de rango -> 400
POST localhost:3000/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{v1_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "loanId": "{{loanId}}",
  "stars": 6
}

### Estrellas no enteras -> 400
POST localhost:3000/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{v1_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "loanId": "{{loanId}}",
  "stars": 3.5
}

### Préstamo inexistente -> 404
POST localhost:3000/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{v1_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "loanId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "stars": 3
}

### vecino3 califica un préstamo ajeno -> 403
POST localhost:3000/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{v3_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "loanId": "{{loanId}}",
  "stars": 1
}

### vecino2 ve sus calificaciones recibidas -> [ { loanId, from: vecino1, stars: 4, comment } ]
GET localhost:3000/reviews/me
Authorization: Bearer {{v2_token}}

### vecino3 no tiene calificaciones -> []
GET localhost:3000/reviews/me
Authorization: Bearer {{v3_token}}

### Artículos muestran el rating del dueño -> rating: 4 en los de vecino2
GET localhost:3000/condominiums/{{condominiumId}}/articles
Authorization: Bearer {{v1_token}}
